      "content": "Thanks, that looks good. It's very professional. Could you actually give me a second version though? Maybe one that's slightly more \"personable\" or \"warm\"? The brand wants to feel like we aren't just a faceless corporation, so something that feels a bit more human and less like a template, while still staying classy. Maybe acknowledge that logistics can be frustrating or unpredictable?",
